~ intro
Bridge: Morning check, diver. Day 1 is not about doing everything.
Bridge: Lay down the starter plots first, give the kitchen one clean lunch win, then leave from the pier when evening opens.
Bridge: If you drift, read the board. Pantry Restock points at the farm, Lunch Rush points at the room, and both are only setting up tonight's cast-off.

~ day2_morning
Bridge: Different morning now. Last night's haul only matters if daylight spends it.
Bridge: Water yesterday's plots before they stall, then decide whether the kitchen, the board, or the stall gets first claim on what you brought back.

~ day3_morning
Bridge: This is the first day the whole machine can pay you back at once.
Bridge: Harvest early, route the fresh stock with purpose, and make the dock compete with real daylight options before you sail again.
